     "eb4b7abd-9298-4364-baad-5ed59cf5a549"], Cell["\<\
Two points determine one and only one line. Here they determine a family.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"930bccf7-559d-43a3-bca3-a442efa2c04d"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
