Cell["\<\
On the 4-cycle the edge 1, 2 extends to 4, 1, 2 and to 1, 2, 3, but not to 4, \
1, 2, 3: two lines through one shortest path, and neither contains the other:\
\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"cfb79896-0d76-4eae-a5a1-2acb040fc1f4"],

